"The format that the disc image is saved in does not store the size of the disc image." = "此光盘镜像的保存格式不存储光盘镜像的大小。";
"This disc image is too small and lacks some data. The problem is most likely that this is a dual-layer disc that has been dumped as a single-layer disc." = "此光盘镜像太小并且缺少一些数据。问题原因很可能这是一个双层光盘但被转储为单层光盘。";
"This disc image is too small and lacks some data. If your dumping program saved the disc image as several parts, you need to merge them into one file." = "此光盘镜像太小并且缺少一些数据。如果你的转储程序将光盘镜像保存为多个部分，则需要将其合并为一个文件。";
"This debug disc image has the size of a retail disc image." = "此调试版光盘镜像和零售版光盘镜像大小一样。";
"This disc image has an unusual size. This will likely make the emulated loading times longer. You will likely be unable to share input recordings and use NetPlay with anyone who is using a good dump." = "此光盘镜像大小异常。这可能会使模拟的加载时间更长。你将无法与正在使用正确转储的其他人共享输入录制和使用联机功能。";
"This disc image has an unusual size." = "此光盘镜像大小异常。";
