"The game ID is unusually short." = "游戏 ID 异常短。";
"The region code does not match the game ID. If this is because the region code has been modified, the game might run at the wrong speed, graphical elements might be offset, or the game might not run at all." = "区域代码与游戏 ID 不匹配。如果这是因为区域代码已被修改，那游戏可能以错误的速度运行、图形元素可能会被偏移或者游戏可能根本无法运行。";
"This Korean title is set to use an IOS that typically isn't used on Korean consoles. This is likely to lead to ERROR #002." = "此韩语游戏设置为使用通常不在韩版主机上用到的 IOS。 这很可能导致错误 #002。";
"This title is set to use an invalid IOS." = "此游戏设置为使用无效的 IOS。";
