"This is a good dump." = "这是一个正确的转储。";
"This is a good dump according to Redump.org, but Dolphin has found problems. This might be a bug in Dolphin." = "依据 Redump.org，这是一个正确的转储，但 Dolphin 发现了问题。这可能是 Dolphin 中的错误。";
"Dolphin is unable to verify unlicensed discs." = "Dolphin 无法验证未经授权的光盘。";
"Dolphin is unable to verify typical TGC files properly, since they are not dumps of actual discs." = "Dolphin 无法正确验证典型的 TGC 文件，因为其不是真实光盘的转储。";
"Dolphin is currently unable to verify Triforce games." = "Dolphin 当前无法验证 Triforce 游戏。";
"Compared to the Wii disc release of the game, this is a bad dump. Despite this, it's possible that this is a good dump compared to the Wii U eShop release of the game. Dolphin can't verify this." = "与游戏的 Wii 光盘发布版本相比，这是错误的转储。尽管如此，与游戏的 Wii U eShop 版本比较的话这可能是一个正确的转储。Dolphin 无法验证这一点。";
"This is a bad dump. This doesn't necessarily mean that the game won't run correctly." = "这是一个错误的转储。但并不一定表示游戏无法正常运行。";
"This is a bad dump." = "这是一个错误的转储。";
"No problems were found. This does not guarantee that this is a good dump, but since Wii titles contain a lot of verification data, it does mean that there most likely are no problems that will affect emulation." = "未发现任何问题。虽然不能保证这是一个正确的转储，但由于 Wii 游戏包含大量的验证数据，这表明几乎不会出现影响模拟的问题。";
"No problems were found." = "未发现任何问题。";
"Compared to the Wii disc release of the game, problems of low severity were found. Despite this, it's possible that this is a good dump compared to the Wii U eShop release of the game. Dolphin can't verify this." = "与游戏的 Wii 光盘发布版本相比，发现了严重程度较低的问题。尽管如此，与游戏的 Wii U eShop 版本比较的话这可能是一个正确的转储。Dolphin 无法验证这一点。";
"Problems with low severity were found. They will most likely not prevent the game from running." = "发现低严重性问题。这些问题很可能不会影响游戏运行。";
"Problems with medium severity were found. The whole game or certain parts of the game might not work correctly." = "发现中等严重性问题。游戏整体或特定部分可能无法正确运行。";
"Problems with high severity were found. The game will most likely not work at all." = "发现高严重性问题。游戏很可能根本无法运作。";
"

Because GameCube disc images contain little verification data, there may be problems that Dolphin is unable to detect." = "

由于 GameCube 光盘镜像包含很少的验证数据，因此可能存在 Dolphin 无法检测到的问题。";
