"Aspect Ratio" = "宽高比";
"Precision Frame Timing" = "精确帧生成计时";
"Uses high resolution timers and \"busy waiting\" for improved frame pacing.<br><br>This will marginally increase power usage.<br><br><dolphin_emphasis>If unsure, leave this checked.</dolphin_emphasis>" = "使用高分辨率计时器和“忙碌等待”来改善帧同步。<br><br>这会略微增加功耗。<br><br><dolphin_emphasis>如无法确定，请选中此项。</dolphin_emphasis>";
"Show NetPlay Ping" = "显示联机延迟";
"Auto-Adjust Window Size" = "自动调整窗口大小";
"Show NetPlay Messages" = "显示联机信息";
"Render to Main Window" = "渲染到主窗口";
