"Defer EFB Copies to RAM" = "推迟 EFB 副本到内存";
"GPU Texture Decoding" = "GPU 纹理解码";
"Accuracy" = "精确度";
"External Frame Buffer (XFB)" = "外部帧缓冲 (XFB)";
"Immediately Present XFB" = "立即呈现 XFB";
"Skip Presenting Duplicate Frames" = "跳过重复出现的帧";
