RVZ: An advanced compressed format which is compatible with Dolphin 5.0-12188 and later. It can efficiently compress both junk data and encrypted Wii data." = "ISO：一种简单而强大的格式，许多程序都支持该格式。比任何其他格式占用更多的空间。

